{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t​運輸署表示，經營運商全力搶修後，咪錶泊車系統已恢復正常運作。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n署方會繼續督促營運商徹查事故原因及提交報告，防止同類事件再發生；至今沒有證據顯示系統被攻擊，並會通報數字政策辦公室。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.577815+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:55.373292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:39:00.476055+00:00","content_hash":"75d486c43d817b2b9fc18cad256b5746847554ed17ed2d3480ff6de62192e29c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}